{
  "name": "Victory",
  "speed": 115,
  "segmentLength": 60,

  // Where the ship goes when a run is finished: a long, empty, gently turning tube that it flies by
  // itself while the results are up. Not part of the run and not reachable by playing - Main loads
  // it by name when the last level ends - so it sits outside the level_NN naming and the guards that
  // walk the chain.
  //
  // Nothing in it. No obstacles, no pickups, no wells, no splits. The player is reading their own
  // times and watching the ship fly; anything to dodge would be asking for attention that is not
  // available, and a ship that crashed on the victory screen would be a poor joke.
